  doc "Shared command identity for admission and dispatch; kinds through 171 and 190 MOVE / 191 SWAPDB run by held parts: 1 GET, 2 SET, 3 INCR, 4 DECR, 5 INCRBY, 6 DECRBY, 7 EXPIRE, 8 PEXPIRE, 9 EXPIREAT, 10 PEXPIREAT, 11 TTL, 12 PTTL, 13 EXPIRETIME, 14 PEXPIRETIME, 15 MSET; 16 DEL, 17 UNLINK, 18 EXISTS, 19 TYPE, 20 PERSIST, 21 DBSIZE, 22 PING, 23 ECHO, 24 SETNX, 25 SETEX, 26 PSETEX, 27 GETSET, 28 GETDEL, 29 GETEX, 30 APPEND, 31 SETRANGE, 32 STRLEN, 33 GETRANGE, 34 MGET, 35 MSETNX, 36 INCRBYFLOAT, 37 RENAME, 38 RENAMENX, 39 COPY; 40 HSET, 41 HMSET, 42 HSETNX, 43 HGET, 44 HMGET, 45 HDEL, 46 HEXISTS, 47 HSTRLEN, 48 HLEN, 49 HGETALL, 50 HKEYS, 51 HVALS, 52 HINCRBY, 53 HINCRBYFLOAT, 54 HRANDFIELD; 60 LPUSH, 61 RPUSH, 62 LPUSHX, 63 RPUSHX, 64 LPOP, 65 RPOP, 66 LRANGE, 67 LLEN, 68 LINDEX, 69 LSET, 70 LREM, 71 LTRIM, 72 LINSERT, 73 LPOS, 74 LMOVE, 75 RPOPLPUSH; 90 SADD, 91 SREM, 92 SPOP, 93 SCARD, 94 SMEMBERS, 95 SISMEMBER, 96 SMISMEMBER, 97 SRANDMEMBER, 98 SMOVE, 99 SINTER, 100 SUNION, 101 SDIFF, 102 SINTERCARD, 103 SINTERSTORE, 104 SUNIONSTORE, 105 SDIFFSTORE; 120 ZADD, 121 ZINCRBY, 122 ZREM, 123 ZPOPMIN, 124 ZPOPMAX, 125 ZCARD, 126 ZSCORE, 127 ZMSCORE, 128 ZRANK, 129 ZREVRANK, 130 ZRANGE, 131 ZREVRANGE, 132 ZRANGEBYSCORE, 133 ZREVRANGEBYSCORE, 134 ZRANGEBYLEX, 135 ZREVRANGEBYLEX, 136 ZCOUNT, 137 ZLEXCOUNT, 138 ZREMRANGEBYRANK, 139 ZREMRANGEBYSCORE, 140 ZREMRANGEBYLEX; 160 TOUCH, 161 SUBSTR, 162 TIME, 163 SELECT, 164 FLUSHALL, 165 FLUSHDB, 166 COMMAND, 168 SCAN, 169 KEYS, 170 RANDOMKEY, 171 OBJECT, 167 is reserved. Network-only kinds are 172 EVAL, 173 EVALSHA, 174 SCRIPT, 175 INFO, 176 CONFIG, 177 AUTH, 178 HELLO, 179 QUIT, 180 CLIENT, 181 DEBUG, 182 FUNCTION, 183 SHUTDOWN, 184 BGREWRITEAOF, 185 MULTI, 186 EXEC, 187 DISCARD, 188 WATCH (only its inside-MULTI refusal), 189 RESET. Names are case insensitive; zero is unknown.";
  let code = name_code(input: input, start: name.start, length: name.length);
